        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;sequenceDiagram\n    actor User\n    participant ResetPasswordPage as ResetPasswordPage&lt;br/&gt;(UI Component)\n    participant AuthHook\n    participant APIClient as APIClient / Axios\n    participant AuthController\n    participant Bcrypt\n    participant EmailService as Email Service\n    participant Database as Prisma Database\n    participant Mailbox as User Mailbox\n\n    note over ResetPasswordPage,Mailbox: Phase 1 — Reset Request\n\n    User -&gt;&gt; ResetPasswordPage: 1. Enter email\n    ResetPasswordPage -&gt;&gt; AuthHook: 2. forgotPassword(email)\n    AuthHook -&gt;&gt; APIClient: 3. POST\n    APIClient -&gt;&gt; AuthController: 4. POST /forgot-password\n    AuthController -&gt;&gt; Database: 5. findUnique(User)\n    Database -&gt;&gt; AuthController: 6. Return user\n    activate AuthController\n\n    alt User not found\n        AuthController -&gt;&gt; APIClient: 7. 200 OK (fake success)\n    else User found\n        AuthController -&gt;&gt; AuthController: 8. Generate token\n        AuthController -&gt;&gt; Database: 9. create EmailToken\n        Database -&gt;&gt; AuthController: 10. Token saved\n        AuthController -&gt;&gt; EmailService: 11. sendResetEmail\n        EmailService -&gt;&gt; Mailbox: 12. Send email\n        AuthController -&gt;&gt; APIClient: 13. 200 OK\n    end\n\n    note over ResetPasswordPage,Mailbox: Phase 2 — Reset Password\n\n    User -&gt;&gt; ResetPasswordPage: 15. Click link + enter new password\n    ResetPasswordPage -&gt;&gt; AuthHook: 17. resetPassword(token, pwd)\n    AuthHook -&gt;&gt; APIClient: 18. POST\n    APIClient -&gt;&gt; AuthController: 19. POST /reset-password\n    AuthController -&gt;&gt; Database: 20. findUnique(EmailToken)\n    Database -&gt;&gt; AuthController: 21. Return token\n\n    alt Invalid token\n        AuthController -&gt;&gt; APIClient: 22. 400 Error\n    else Valid token\n        AuthController -&gt;&gt; Bcrypt: 23. hash(password)\n        Bcrypt -&gt;&gt; AuthController: 24. passwordHash\n        AuthController -&gt;&gt; Database: 25. update User\n        Database -&gt;&gt; AuthController: OK\n        AuthController -&gt;&gt; Database: 26. mark token used\n        Database -&gt;&gt; AuthController: OK\n        AuthController -&gt;&gt; APIClient: 27. OK\n    end\n\n    APIClient -&gt;&gt; AuthHook: onSuccess\n    AuthHook -&gt;&gt; ResetPasswordPage: onSuccess\n    ResetPasswordPage -&gt;&gt; User: Success message&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="co1BCHjESa3RrrmItlmZ-1">
          <mxCell parent="1" style="shape=image;noLabel=1;verticalAlign=top;imageAspect=1;image=data:image/svg+xml,;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry height="2063" width="2112" x="-850" y="1570" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
